ifaddrs-android
===============

Upstream:  https://github.com/kmackay/android-ifaddrs
Authors:   Kenneth MacKay (implementation)
           Berkeley Software Design, Inc. (the BSDI <ifaddrs.h> interface)

Used by librats as: 3rdparty/android/ifaddrs-android.c
                    3rdparty/android/ifaddrs-android.h

Compiled only when targeting Android API level < 24, where bionic does not
yet provide getifaddrs(). It is not part of any other platform build.

SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause AND BSD-1-Clause

